ORTLAND and he will take file requests. The address is 1/152/1.0
and the number is (503) 746-6990 or (503) 726-1815.  He has a couple
of 9600 baud HST modems.
 
If you cannot get it from ORTLAND send me a mail message and I can
send you the file via mail.  Our site is rather cramped for disk
space and I cannot just leave it up all the time so requests will
get put in a pile and processed all at once.
 
A final way is for you to send me a disk (any size or format) and I will
send it back to you.  If possible, enclose return postage.
 
