A final note, although this version is current to patchlevel 3, the bottom
line is that MSDOS restricts us to 640 K.  Most but not features have been
included.  I have been working with Hack for several years, never 
"releasing" a version outside my own group of friends, so I know what I am
doing.  I have yet to have it crash due to a internal error.  This compile 
is very close to the patch to Turbo C 2.0 by Mike Threepoint (included 
in patch 3).   Although I have made a few changes, the credit really 
belongs to him.
 
